WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
[Music] Bring your server to the Friends tab.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.830
Get Mcbe2Friends from GitHub.
Choose the download for your computer.

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:07.200
Extract the download. On Windows,
open Mcbe2Friends.exe.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.130
Enter your server’s Bedrock address
and port, then choose Continue.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:15.930
Choose Connect & start. Use the code
to sign in on Microsoft’s page.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:20.000
Add the broadcaster’s Xbox gamertag.
In Minecraft Bedrock, open Play → Friends.
